{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20533","headline":"答白杭州郡楼登望画图见寄 · 张籍","name":"答白杭州郡楼登望画图见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画得江城登望处，寄来今日到长安。\n乍惊物色从诗出，更想工人下手难。\n将展书堂偏觉好，每来朝客尽求看。\n见君向此闲吟意，肯恨当时作外官。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}